OL,3,AMichael Ball's wedding surprise after
OL,4,Aradio proposal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple whose surprise radio proposal
OL,7,Fcaptured hearts across the country were
OL,8,Fgiven an unforgettable wedding gift
OL,9,Fwhen singer and broadcaster Michael
OL,10,FBall turned up to perform at their
OL,11,Fceremony.
OL,13,FDawn Lloyd was shocked when her partner
OL,14,Fof more than 25 years Dave proposed on
OL,15,FBBC Radio 2's Love Songs with Michael
OL,16,FBall programme in the summer and was
OL,17,Fstunned all over again when the
OL,18,Fpresenter appeared at the couple's
OL,19,Fwedding at Weston Hall, in Stafford, on
OL,20,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
